@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Added ``beacons.status`` to report, for each beacon configured on a minion, the timestamp of its
+last actual run and the error (if any) raised during that run. Status is tracked live as beacons
+fire, so it requires no log parsing, no waiting for another probe cycle, and no minion restart. A
+beacon that has not fired yet is reported with ``last_run`` and ``last_error`` set to ``None``.
